        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 851, Balance 3 Inch Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3 Inch Balance Cabinet Pull is available in stunning finish color options. The Balance Cabinet Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. This simple pull is sure to add big style to your kitchen cabinets. It can also be used as a furniture pull or in the bathroom on the vanity.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+Balance\">MNG Balance Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 851 Balance 3 Inch Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
